## Data licence note

The above MIT licence covers the **code only** (the `.qmd` report, the
`.R` Shiny application, and any scripts in this repository).

`NEW_NGCDF_DATA_28-JAN_2026.csv` is **not** original work of the authors.
It is compiled from public disclosures by the National Government
Constituencies Development Fund (NGCDF) Board and voter registration
statistics published by the Independent Electoral and Boundaries
Commission (IEBC). Any reuse of the underlying data should credit these
original sources directly (see `references.bib` and `DATA_DICTIONARY.md`)
and should comply with the terms under which each agency publishes its
data. This project's authors make no ownership claim over the underlying
government data, only over the analysis, code, and written report built
on top of it.
